  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">hCa - Our Resistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the Kvinnna till Kvinna Foundation&apos;s regional programme &quot;Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents&quot; the partner organisation Helsinki Citizens&apos; Assembly Banjaluka is implementing  the 12-month project &quot;Our Resistance&quot;. The project aims to strengthen cooperation and establish new contacts with WRO and CSO organizations, both formal and informal networks, media outlets, and targeted domestic and international stakeholders. This objective behind this effort is to increase the understanding of the potentially devastating impact of the anti-democratic movements on achieved rights and freedoms in Bosnia and Herzegovina.</narrative>
  </description>
